<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>TANKERS - Pactol River - (built 1981) sold for $10 million.</p>
<p>TWEENDECKERS - Thea S - (built 1982) 8,350 dwt sold for $6 million to Singaporean buyers.</p>
<p>REEFERS - Tokachi - (built 1985) sold to Kappa Maritime buyers for $4.5 million.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to inspection, survey or other conditions.</p>
</text>
